# The seven pages (spec, Controls: Pages), drawn in AMB-1's look: each page's button, a screenshot of each while
# stopped (the transport's preview: the template's patterns, the project's values) and while the Full ensemble
# plays. The values the pages work out, checked:
#   lanes         the Perform page's voice lanes (the running engine's voices; stopped, the preview's)
#   lcm_tenths    the convergence (Convergence.period of every lane's loop length) as the page shows it, read back
#   lcm_secs      from its text: the bars in tenths (whole, or to a tenth as the Mac's %.1f, half to even) and the
#                 seconds at the tempo shown, rounded (the Mac's "~ N s"); -1 for "INF". lcm_tenthsP / lcm_secsP:
#                 the same for a period of P ticks
#   note_check    the register's note names, C3 = 60 (Ableton, Logic: Ruling AE), shown and said: the misses
#   deg_label_max the Pattern page's highest degree label: 1 up to the key's notes (floor_mod, as bl_resolve)
#   delay_msV     the Delay page's time for the template's voice V: DelayHint (dotted 8th on the plucks and the
#                 heartbeat, 8th on the bass and the drone, quarter on the pad and the lead), 60000 / bpm x beats,
#                 rounded to the nearest, ties away
#   delay_check   the integer DelayHint against Swift's (60000.0 / bpm * beats).rounded() in binary64 (f64.h), every
#                 tempo 40-220 and each division: the mismatches
# The Full ensemble at 96 BPM: 6 voices, loops of 16 steps, 15 steps, 16 bars, 7 bars, 2 bars and 1 bar, which meet
# again after 1680 bars (4200 s); the delays 469 ms (45000 / 96 = 468.75), 313 ms (312.5, a tie: away) and 625 ms.
# (each shot waits for the header's message to go: 1.3 s)
# ---- the defaults (nothing saved): the Demo trio, its seed still to be drawn at the first Play
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 100
expect seeded 0
shot setup_defaults.png
tap HOME
wait 100
expect lanes 3
shot perform_defaults.png
proj template full 0x5EED1234
wait 200
expect delay_check 0
expect note_check 0
# the convergence's text: a loop of 15 steps (0.9375 bars: "0.9"), a quarter (0.25: "0.2", half to even), three
# quarters ("0.8"), 1.96 bars ("2.0"), nil ("INF"), at 96 BPM
expect lcm_tenths3600 9
expect lcm_secs3600 2
expect lcm_tenths960 2
expect lcm_tenths2880 8
expect lcm_tenths7540 20
expect lcm_tenths-1 -1
expect lcm_secs-1 -1
# ---- stopped: the preview
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 0
expect lanes 6
expect lcm_tenths 16800
expect lcm_secs 4200
shot perform_stopped.png
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 1
shot voice_stopped.png
tap ARP
wait 100
expect view 2
shot pattern_stopped.png
tap LFO
wait 100
expect view 3
shot cc_stopped.png
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect view 4
shot arranger_stopped.png
tap FX
wait 100
expect view 5
expect delay_ms0 469
expect delay_ms1 469
expect delay_ms2 313
expect delay_ms3 625
expect delay_ms4 625
expect delay_ms5 469
shot delay_stopped.png
tap GLO
wait 100
expect view 6
shot setup_stopped.png
# ---- playing: the running engine
tap PLAY
wait 4300
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 0
expect lanes 6
expect lcm_tenths 16800
shot perform_playing.png
# the selected voice: the Pad (SELECT steps over the template's voices: Pluck 1, Pluck 2, Bass, Pad)
turn SELECT 3
wait 1400
tap ENV
wait 100
expect voice_sel 3
expect view 1
shot voice_playing.png
tap ARP
wait 100
expect view 2
shot pattern_playing.png
tap LFO
wait 100
expect view 3
shot cc_playing.png
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect view 4
shot arranger_playing.png
tap FX
wait 100
expect view 5
expect delay_ms2 313
shot delay_playing.png
tap GLO
wait 100
expect view 6
shot setup_playing.png
# ---- the tempo moves the delays: 120 BPM (HOME + SELECT), from the next bar
press HOME
spin SELECT 24
release HOME
wait 3000
tap FX
wait 100
expect bpm 120
expect delay_ms0 375
expect delay_ms2 250
expect delay_ms3 500
expect lcm_secs 3360
# ---- the Pattern page's degrees in the key sounding: Pluck 1's pattern (a degree 7 in A minor) in A minor
# pentatonic from the next bar: its degrees counted in the pentatonic's 5 notes
turn SELECT -3
tap ARP
wait 100
expect voice_sel 0
expect deg_label_max 7
proj key 9 minorPentatonic
wait 3000
expect deg_label_max <6
wait 1400
shot pattern_pentatonic.png
# ---- a template switch while playing: the horizon says it takes over at the next bar
tap HOME
turn PRESET 1
wait 100
expect tpl 2
shot perform_switch.png
# ---- the arranger running: Ambient drift (its arrangement on), the Perform page's horizon and the Arranger page
tap PLAY
proj template ambient 0x5EED1234
tap PLAY
wait 6000
tap HOME
wait 100
shot perform_ambient.png
tap SEQ
wait 100
shot arranger_ambient.png
tap LFO
wait 100
shot cc_ambient.png
# ---- a voice muted and one locked: the lanes say so (the Drone plays from the start; Pluck 2 still WAITS)
tapkey 5
key 1 down
tap SEL
key 1 up
tap HOME
wait 1400
expect muted5 1
expect locked1 1
expect active1 0
shot perform_marks.png
# ---- a help card in the page's place
press FX
wait 1100
shot help_fx.png
release FX
